Dyson provides free equipment pickup for out-of-warranty and in-warranty repairs through direct courier partnerships, with same-day in-person service available in select centers or 14-21 day shipped repair turnarounds. Warranty covers defective units within coverage period; all repairs use genuine Dyson parts. By controlling reverse logistics directly, Dyson manages repair quality, captures teardown data for design improvement, and prevents unauthorized repair channels from damaging brand. This approach democratizes access to manufacturer service while securing intellectual property and data rights.